{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd26 GraveNight \u2013 Welcome to Your Night Shift at the cemetery \ud83d\udd2a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This video game may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GraveNight is a multiplayer horror game where you and your friends take on the eerie role of cemetery guardians. Each night, you're assigned randomized tasks \u2013 from trimming overgrown grass, to cleaning up mortuaries, to allowing only specific visitors to enter. But beware: not every visitor comes in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Gameplay Highlights:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Randomized Nightly Missions</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept only relatives of the deceased, clean haunted mortuaries, cut the grass around specific graves, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras/48bffead8b03fa516295c6e342db5726.avif?t=1765835309\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras_big/48bffead8b03fa516295c6e342db5726.webp?t=1765835309 width=1560 height=853 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Gatekeeper Choices</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You're in control of who enters the cemetery. Visitors may be grieving loved ones... or vandals in disguise. Accept bribes, turn people away, or make judgment calls \u2013 but every choice has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Paranormal Activity</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the nights pass, strange and unexplainable events begin to occur. Lights burn out, CCTV cameras malfunction, and something... watches you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras/204a6257a0c2ede9a0b5558a92b4670b.avif?t=1765835309\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras_big/204a6257a0c2ede9a0b5558a92b4670b.webp?t=1765835309 width=1560 height=849 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Clean Up or Pay Up</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Let a vandal in? Expect graffiti. Didn\u2019t clean it? Say goodbye to your pay. Use your broom to sweep away messes \u2013 or to shoo away suspicious NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras/0c7adda5ee39659e658d5cb1aa2b0a4b.poster.avif?t=1765835309\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras/0c7adda5ee39659e658d5cb1aa2b0a4b.webm?t=1765835309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras/0c7adda5ee39659e658d5cb1aa2b0a4b.mp4?t=1765835309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras/8c51cad8cb76ebbcbae00371e43bef58.poster.avif?t=1765835309\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras/8c51cad8cb76ebbcbae00371e43bef58.webm?t=1765835309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras/8c51cad8cb76ebbcbae00371e43bef58.mp4?t=1765835309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Tech-savvy Terror</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your in-game laptop to check CCTV feeds, track grave locations, monitor upgrades, and stay one step ahead of the horror lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras/5b7522f63da8ee703ff5390a276502dd.poster.avif?t=1765835309\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras/5b7522f63da8ee703ff5390a276502dd.webm?t=1765835309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/extras/5b7522f63da8ee703ff5390a276502dd.mp4?t=1765835309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Survive each night. Keep the cemetery clean. Uncover the secrets behind the paranormal. And most importantly... trust no one.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966460?t=1765835309","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/ca555de5a5767809223e4e78db510371aec4c6e3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765835309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/c0e1c2d84e73377292efbaf1f3cb0b0d623e2262/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765835309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966460/c0e1c2d84e73377292efbaf1f3cb0b0d623e2262/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765835309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls"